device PIC18F47Q10
hwtool sim
program /Users/stevekerr/mydocs/code/PicAmpControl/out/My_Pic_Project_18F47Q10/default.elf

write pin RA0 0v
write pin RA1 0v
write pin RA2 0v
write pin RA3 0v
write pin RA5 2.5v
write pin RB1 0v
write pin RB2 0v
write pin RB3 0v
write pin RB4 0v
write pin RC2 5v
write pin RB0 5v
write pin RB6 5v
write pin RC0 high

Stepi 300000
print g_startup_elapsed_ms
Stopwatch
Stepi 300000
print g_startup_elapsed_ms
Stopwatch
Stepi 300000
print g_startup_elapsed_ms
Stopwatch
quit
